#: lib/dtu_app_web/controllers/page_html/privacy.html.heex:44
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "To keep you signed in, we store a session token in an HTTP-only cookie. We log basic request metadata (timestamp, status, route) for security and debugging."
